      <h2>Something to try before we ever meet</h2>
      <p>Longer out-breaths than in-breaths tell a nervous system it is allowed to stand down.
      One minute is enough to feel the difference, which is also the argument for teaching it to
      clients before you teach them anything else.</p>
      <p>If the circle distracts you, ignore it and count: in for four, hold for two, out for
      six.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="settle" data-running="false">
      <div class="settle__ring"><span>one minute</span></div>
      <button type="button">Start</button>
      <p>In for four, hold for two, out for six.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

